rket:"Market day",of_garden:"Garden party",of_winter:"Winter woollies",of_rodeo:"Rodeo",of_show:"Show day",ofd_classic:"Straw hat and a checked shirt.",ofd_market:"Tweed flat cap and a blue checked shirt.",ofd_garden:"Flowery sun hat and a yellow gingham shirt.",ofd_winter:"Bobble hat and a green jumper.",ofd_rodeo:"Cowboy hat, chambray shirt and a neckerchief.",ofd_show:"Top hat, white shirt and a prize rosette.",out_buy:"Buy and wear \xB7 {c}",out_wear:"Wear",out_wearing:"Wearing",out_bought:"{farmer} tries on the {name} outfit! +{xp} XP",out_worn:"{farmer} is wearing the {name} outfit.",out_new:"New outfit for {farmer}: {names}",away_title:"While you were away",away_for:"You were away {t}.",away_paused:"You were away more than 2 days: your hens laid for the last two.",away_eggs:"{n} eggs are waiting in your nests",away_eggs1:"An egg is waiting in a nest",away_full:"{n} nests are full: those hens have stopped laying",away_full1:"A nest is full: those hens have stopped laying",away_hatched:"{name} hatched {n} chicks",away_grown:"{name}\u2019s chicks have grown up: their card is next",away_honey:"{n} jars of honey in the hives",away_honey1:"A jar of honey in the hives",away_feathers:"{n} peacock feathers to pick up",away_feathers1:"A peacock feather to pick up",away_apple_egg:"{n} apple eggs under the apple trees",away_apple_egg1:"An apple egg under the apple tree",away_wheat:"Your wheat is ripe: tap the field to harvest it",away_wheat_grow:"Your wheat is growing: ripe in {t}",away_feed:"{coop}: the feeder is empty",away_feed_low:"{coop}: the feeder is low",away_show:"The show results are in: they\u2019re next",away_jobs:"New jobs for today",away_jobs_ready:"{n} job rewards to collect",away_jobs_ready1:"A job reward to collect",away_collect:"Collect all eggs ({n})",away_ok:"Off to the farm",away_sold:"{n} eggs sold \xB7 +{c} coins",intro_1:"Your forever flock",intro_1b:"Your three Rhode Island Reds are yours for good, and each has a personality of its own: a Diva, a Rebel, a Glutton\u2026 Cuddle them: they trust you more, earn stars and lay better eggs.",intro_2:"Eggs and chicks",intro_2b:"Each hen lays about two eggs a day: collect them to sell. Now and then a hen raises chicks; grown up, they leave for a new farm and you earn coins.",intro_3:"Land and new breeds",intro_3b:"Each level, another field of the farm can be restored, and new breeds arrive as trios with their own coop. Put everything where you like.",intro_4:"Shows, honey and more",intro_4b:"Win rosettes at shows, go fishing in the pond and the river, grow wheat for the feeders, decorate your farm and sell honey. At your own pace: a little each day.",intro_5:"Rusty the fox",intro_5b:"From level 4, Rusty may come by at night for the eggs; he never harms a bird. Shut the coops\u2019 doors at dusk, or let a Brave hen, the geese or your dog chase him off.",intro_next:"Next",intro_go:"Let\u2019s go!",intro_skip:"Skip",story_1:"Grandma has left you her farm, with a letter: \u201CLook after my hens. The rest will come, one step at a time.\u201D",story_2:"Feather & Field is yours now. Her three Rhode Island Reds are waiting at the gate.",story_3:"Every field is yours, but the weeds have taken them back. Each one needs work, and coins, to bring it back to life.",story_4:"Collect the eggs, care for your hens, and bring the farm back to life, field by field.",settings_story:"\u{1F4DC} The farm\u2019s story",guide_n:"First day \xB7 {n} of {of}",guide_skip:"Skip",guide_show:"Show me",guide_eggs:"Collect your first egg: tap the egg over the Red Barn.",guide_eggs_wait:"Your first egg is on its way: a hen will go in to lay in a moment.",guide_cuddle:"Give a hen a cuddle: tap a hen, then \u2665 Cuddle.",guide_cuddle_card:"Now tap \u2665 Cuddle.",guide_sow:"Sow your wheat field: tap its sign, then Sow.",guide_sow_card:"Tap Sow: the wheat will feed your hens.",guide_jobs:"Today\u2019s jobs: tap the clipboard at the top.",guide_shop:"Tap your coins: the shop for decorations, animals and outfits.",guide_did:"Well done! +{c} coins, +{x} XP",guide_done:"Your first day is done! +{c} coins, +{x} XP",jobs_title:"Today\u2019s jobs",jobs_aria:"Today\u2019s jobs",jobs_new:"new jobs today",jobs_ready:"{n} to collect",job_eggs:"Collect {n} eggs",job_eggs1:"Collect an egg",job_cuddle:"Give {n} cuddles",job_cuddle1:"Give a cuddle",job_feed:"Fill a feeder",job_show:"Enter a bird in a show",job_reward:"+{c} coins \xB7 +{xp} XP",job_claim:"Collect",job_paid:"Done \u2713",jobs_note:"New jobs every day at midnight.",job_done:"Job done: {job}! Collect your reward in Today\u2019s jobs.",job_claimed:"+{c} coins \xB7 +{xp} XP",show_sign_v:"Village Show",show_sign_c:"County Show",show_sign_n:"National Championship",showday_title:"Show day!",showday_body:"The results of the {show} are in: the judge is looking at the birds.",showday_watch:"Watch the judging",showday_results:"Just the results",skip:"Skip",sd_arrive:"{farmer} brings {name} to the show\u2026",sd_judge:"The judge looks at every bird\u2026",sd_rosettes:"And now, the rosettes!",champ_c:"County champion",champ_n:"National champion",show_new_c:"The County show: entry {f}, 1st prize {p} coins",show_new_n:"The National Championship: entry {f}, 1st prize {p} coins",book_sil:"White Silkie",egg_rir:"Brown eggs",egg_orp:"Light brown eggs",egg_sil:"Cream-tinted eggs",egg_leg:"Blue eggs",egg_bra:"Light brown eggs",egg_pol:"White eggs",egg_aya:"Cream eggs",egg_call:"Pale green duck eggs",egg_pea:"Big cream peafowl eggs",coins_body:"Coins come from your eggs and your grown chicks. You\u2019ll spend them on feed, land, coops and more.",settings_music:"Music",settings_sounds:"Sounds",music_on:"On",music_off:"Off",settings_music_note:"The music comes now and then, by day and of an evening.",settings_lang:"Language",settings_new:"Start a new farm",settings_new_sure:"Tap again to start again from nothing",settings_edited:"This farm was changed outside the game: everything in it has been checked.",settings_version:"Version {v}"